[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2636897103","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102456#issuecomment-2636897103","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102456","id":2636897103,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dK9tP","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T13:45:45Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T13:47:02Z","body":"I think this would be best broken up into parts, so that individual cases can be evaluated and discussed more easily, 258 files (especially with a mix of uses of the methods and the method declarations themselves, which is unavoidable but clutters things for review) is a lot to review","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2636897103/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2636937450","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102456#issuecomment-2636937450","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102456","id":2636937450,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dLHjq","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T14:02:25Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T14:17:30Z","body":"At a glance some of these cases are IMO not valid, like the `ResourceImporter::import`, if there's cases in that use which don't do pointer checks they should be fixed instead, but with the overwhelming size of this it's hard to tell exactly\r\n\r\nI think the important discussion is which cases are cases where the argument being optional is unintentional and should be changed, and which are intentional and the null checks are missing, because (to clarify) the reason for passing by pointer is to make it optional, which is why we want the null-check when they have them","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2636937450/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637017917","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102456#issuecomment-2637017917","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102456","id":2637017917,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dLbM9","user":{"login":"YYF233333","id":67693830,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3NjkzODMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67693830?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333","html_url":"https://github.com/YYF233333","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YYF233333/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T14:33:09Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T14:33:09Z","body":"I'm afraid it is not a trival task to split this into orthogonal parts, these changes are connected by function def/impl and cannot be splitted at folder/file scope.\r\n\r\n`ResourceImporter::import` is a special case, optional params are omitted only in tests. I can split this part for further discussion. The remaining changes should have only touched `&` and `->` and are quite simple in structure.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637017917/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637022910","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102456#issuecomment-2637022910","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102456","id":2637022910,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dLca-","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T14:34:51Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T14:34:51Z","body":"They can be split by method case, but at least for me this is far too large to review responsibly, and I tend to not balk at large PRs but this is very mixed and convoluted","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637022910/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637290917","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102456#issuecomment-2637290917","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102456","id":2637290917,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dMd2l","user":{"login":"adamscott","id":270928,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MDkyOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/270928?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott","html_url":"https://github.com/adamscott","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/adamscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T15:44:11Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T15:44:11Z","body":"@YYF233333 It's not your first broad PR. Like @AThousandShips says, it's preferable to split these kind of broad PRs into targeted PRs. Because otherwise, I'm guaranteeing that broad sweeping changes will introduce complex and hard to debug issues in the long run.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637290917/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637307053","html_url":"https://github.